  "title": "Cueing the future to reduce temporal discounting",
  "description": "EEG dataset investigating whether episodic future thinking can reduce temporal discounting. Participants described a series of personal future events and were then cued to think about these events while making intertemporal choices. They also rated the vividness of their mental imagery for each event.",
